WEBVTT

00:00:58.816 --> 00:01:00.499
you go back to your desk,

00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:02.008
and you stand at your 
desk and you say,

00:01:02.008 --> 00:01:04.671
"Boy, I wish I had those two hours back,

00:01:04.671 --> 00:01:06.674
like I wish I had my chair back."

00:01:06.674 --> 00:01:08.180
(Laughter)

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.751
Every day, we allow our coworkers,

00:01:10.751 --> 00:01:12.965
who are otherwise very, 
very nice people,

00:01:12.965 --> 00:01:14.632
to steal from us.

00:01:14.632 --> 00:01:18.710
And I'm talking about something far 
more valuable than office furniture.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:21.739
I'm talking about time. Your time.

00:01:21.739 --> 00:01:24.392
In fact, I believe that

00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:26.877
we are in the middle
of a global epidemic

00:01:26.877 --> 00:01:31.917
of a terrible new illness
known as MAS: